  << /ActualText (CRYPTOACCOUNTING\056fr\054 France\056 May 2023 \055 Now\nRole and Responsibilities\072\nActed as the primary full\055stack engineer for the platform\054 responsible for approximately 90\045 of the software system during my engagement\056\nDesigned\054 built\054 and maintained the core backend architecture\054 REST APIs\054 database models\054 business logic\054 authentication\054 and authorization flows\056\nDeveloped the frontend application and internal dashboards used to manage crypto accounting workflows\054 user data\054 imports\054 reports\054 and platform operations\056\nBuilt complex data import and processing flows for crypto transactions\054 including CSV\057API ingestion\054 validation\054 normalization\054 and accounting\055oriented transformations\056\nImplemented production deployment workflows\054 server configuration\054 environment management\054 monitoring practices\054 and cloud infrastructure setup\056\nWorked directly with stakeholders to translate accounting\054 compliance\054 and product requirements into usable software features\056\nTechnologies used\072 Node\056js\054 JavaScript\054 TypeScript\054 Vue\054 Nuxt\056js\054 MongoDB\054 AWS\054 REST APIs\054 Linux server deployment)
